tools/sit: StuffIt 1.5.1-compatible (Classic SIT, stored) archive writer for MoofTCP releases.

Origin: SitStill (local checkout ~/projects/sitstill), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 SitStill contributors; the license text is in LICENSE next to this file.
Copied unchanged: classic_sit_writer.c, stream.c, sitstill/classic_sit.h, sitstill/stream.h.
Trimmed: classic_sit_internal.h (decoder declarations removed).
Extracted: sit_crc.c (the CRC-16 functions of classic_sit_codecs.c, so the decoders are not needed).
